# Safe reference only: this Compose stack does not require a real .env file.
# Runtime host and secret paths are configured in Compose, for example:
# MQTT_HOST=broker
# MQTT_PASSWORD_FILE=/run/secrets/device_password
# Keep passwords only in Git-ignored pep/mosquitto/secrets/ files.
# Provision matching Dynamic Security identities separately; see README.md.
# Never put real credentials, tokens or private keys in tracked examples.
